| Average AuMA | ±£1bn | ±~6.3p (±15%) |
| Revenue margin | ±1bp | ±~3.0p (±7%) |
| Adjusted operating costs | ±£2m | ±~2.3p (±6%) |
| Diluted share count | ±2m | -/+~1.3p (-/+3%) |
| Equity markets | ±10% | ±~10p (±24%) |

